//
// The natives of a plain program by the number `OpStaticCall` carries (@PLN91,
// doc/claude/plans/91-self-host/rust-dependencies.md step 2): the run image's `natives` table
// kept in loft, so the bytecode writer needs none from an image.  The order is the number: a
// new native is added at the end.  A program that loads a library with natives of its own has
// those after these, which this table does not hold yet.
//
// `selfhost/bench/bgen_check.loft --stream` compares it with the image's table.

